{"id":"9c4942e19ffe0b7be30ac34cf1901f485348bdce","axis":"silent","repo":"vimeo/psalm","sha":"9c4942e19ffe0b7be30ac34cf1901f485348bdce","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/running_psalm/common_issues.md","lines":["@@ -25,3 +25,5 @@ The type comes from a docblock, which Psalm trusts, so a check against it is red"," ## Reporting a bug"," "," Please include a link to [psalm.dev](https://psalm.dev) that reproduces it, or the smallest code and `psalm.xml` that do.","+","+If Psalm crashed, attach the `crash-*.txt` file it names after `Full report:`; the link it prints fills in the rest of the issue. `PSALM_CRASH_REPORT=<dir>` writes that file to another directory, and `PSALM_CRASH_REPORT=0` turns it off."],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"skills/psalm/references/debugging.md","lines":["@@ -31,9 +31,12 @@ wrong is where the fix belongs: a missing return type, a missing template, an un"," "," ## Psalm crashes or hangs"," ","-- Exit code `1` with a PHP error or \"Psalm crashed\": rerun with `--debug` (it runs on one thread) to see the","-  last file it was working on.","-- To find the statement: `--debug-by-line <file>`.","+- Exit code `1` with \"Psalm crashed\": the output names the plugin that threw, the statement it was analysing","+  (\"while analysing ... at file:line\"), and after `Full report:` a file with the versions, config and whole","+  trace (`PSALM_CRASH_REPORT=<dir>` moves it, `PSALM_CRASH_REPORT=0` turns it off). A crash in a plugin goes","+  to the plugin's tracker; the link Psalm prints fills in the issue.","+- No statement named: rerun with `--debug` (it runs on one thread) to see the last file it was working on,","+  then `--debug-by-line <file>` to find the statement."," - Memory: `--memory-limit=4G`."," - Slow: `--no-cache --debug-performance` (short name `--profile`) prints where the time went (`docs/running_psalm/performance.md`)."," - Reduce it to a small repro: [bug-report.md](bug-report.md)."],"additions":6,"deletions":3,"truncat